              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Anne Jones Hollis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As catfish goes, this was a good base recipe. In the future I would use more salt and perhaps add some granulated garlic to boost the flavor. The amount of oil needed was way overestimated. In my cast iron skillet, I was able to fry up all the fish in just 1 cup of oil!"
