            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Vanessa Schott"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After reading the recommendations below I added additional Lawry’s seasoning salt and a fish herb blend instead of thyme. Since the catfish came directly from our pond I also soaked the nuggets in milk for 20 minutes before dredging. For my nuggets I used gluten-free baking flour instead of regular flour I used for my family and whole family was loving it!",
